<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    position: 'relative',
    background: '#0B3D2E',
    padding: 0,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, right: 0, width: '704px', height: '720px' }}>
        <Image src="assets/chapter_1.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 0, left: 0,
            width: '100%', height: '100%',
            background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #0B3D2E 0%, rgba(11,61,46,.55) 30%, rgba(11,61,46,.12) 62%, rgba(11,61,46,.28) 100%)',
        }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '720px', height: '720px',
        padding: '84px 56px 68px 72px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        justifyContent: 'space-between',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 3, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.62)', letterSpacing: 3 }}>
                CHAPTER
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22 }}>
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 96,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#C75B12',
                lineHeight: 0.98,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", serif',
            }}>
                01
            </Text>
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 54,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#F7F3EA',
                lineHeight: 1.24,
                letterSpacing: 2,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                會議為什麼
                <br />
                會壞掉
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, maxWidth: 470 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 2, background: 'rgba(240,160,80,.5)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.80)', lineHeight: 1.72 }}>
                我們不是不會開會，我們是把開會做成了儀式。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
